    "reporting_guidance": [
      "State the exact social concept first, then explain the relationship, target, and context.",
      "Use article 17 for dignity and discrimination issues, article 12 for public-order or rumor-driven problems, article 8 for family and caregiving issues, article 4 for civility and conduct issues, and article 18 for cohesion and identity issues.",
      "If the text is discussion, criticism, satire, educational, documentary, news, fictional, dreamlike, flashback, or quotation, say so explicitly and downgrade or reject the finding as appropriate.",
      "When the scene involves multiple speakers, multiple targets, or cross-sentence meaning, explain that in the report instead of flattening it."
    ]
